      644.16,
      310.47,
      692.39
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 01Name of Land: Gedarawatta; Description: Open bare land;Claimed by: Saunda Hannadige Ghanasiri, Suduwalla,Kottagoda; Extent: 0.0031 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
