    "bbox": [
      322.56,
      483.36,
      562.92,
      601.43
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land are herebyrequired to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized inwriting, before me at the Dickwella Divisional Secretary's Officeon 02.08.2019 at10.30 a.m. are hereby requested to notify tome in writing (in Duplicate) on or before 26.07.2019 the natureof there interest in the land, the particulars of there claims forcomepnesation for the acquisition of the said lands the amountof compensation and the details of the computation of suchamount All deeds and documents in support of the claimsshould be produced before me at the inquiry.",
